-07-27#:~:text=He%20put%20his%20hand,moved%20it%20into%20position.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Promised End","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2016-07-27","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/promised-end-2016-07-27","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/promised-end-2016-07-27#:~:text=He%20put%20his%20hand,moved%20it%20into%20position.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Promised End\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 27 Jul 2016."}},{"id":"promised-end-2016-07-27-e19","summary":"Jace's chess pieces mutate and kill each other, and the angel says they were always her pieces and she no longer wants to play.","participants":["emeria","jace-beleren"],"location":"jace-s-mental-tower","importance":"minor","page":"stories/promised-end-2016-07-27","order":126,"story_date":"2016-07-27","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":144,"quote":"They are all my pieces, Jace Beleren.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/promised-end-2016-07-27#:~:text=They%20are%20all%20my%20pieces%2C%20Jace%20Beleren.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Promised End","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2016-07-27","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/promised-end-2016-07-27","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/promised-end-2016-07-27#:~:text=They%20are%20all%20my%20pieces%2C%20Jace%20Beleren.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Promised End\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 27 Jul 2016."}},{"id":"promised-end-2016-07-27-e21","summary":"Jace meets a copy of himself that makes him answer a riddle to prove he is Jace.","participants":["jace-beleren","contingency-jace"],"location":"jace-s-mental-tower","importance":"minor","page":"stories/promised-end-2016-07-27","order":126,"story_date":"2016-07-27